# | Moxa ioLogik R1240 Remote RTU I/O — 8-channel AI
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik R1200 Series User Manual V3.2, November 2017 (Appendix)
# | Protocol: Modbus RTU (RS-485); 9600 8N1 default, address configurable via software
# | 
# | AI channels (ch0-7):
# | FC03 addr 0x02C0-0x02C7 (704-711): AI range ch0-7 (0=0-10V, 1=0-20mA, 2=4-20mA burnout)
# | FC03 addr 0x02E0,0x02E2...0x02EE (736,738,...750): AI burnout value ch0-7 (f32, 2 words/ch, step-2)
# | FC04 addr 0x02C0-0x02C7 (704-711): AI raw value ch0-7
# | FC04 addr 0x02E0-0x02E7 (736-743): AI min raw value ch0-7
# | FC04 addr 0x0300-0x0307 (768-775): AI max raw value ch0-7
# | FC04 addr 0x0320,0x0322...0x032E (800,802,...814): AI eng. value ch0-7 (f32, step-2 pairs)
# | FC04 addr 0x0360,0x0362...0x036E (864,866,...878): AI min eng. value ch0-7 (f32, step-2 pairs)
# | FC04 addr 0x03A0,0x03A2...0x03AE (928,930,...942): AI max eng. value ch0-7 (f32, step-2 pairs)
